  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模組需要精緻儲存（Refined Storage）</span></span></span></span></strong></span></a></h2><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#000\"><br><span style=\"color:#000\">如果你想將此模組加入你的模組包，歡迎使用 :)</span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">此模組僅新增創造模式合成器。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">創造模式合成器：108個圖樣欄位，即時合成，預設消耗0 RF<br><br></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;創造模式合成器配方</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/350/737/310/172/creative_crafter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p>\n</div><p><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WpUmcmUayN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/40115388/ec29dadf15db1421b9984cc1234b28314f448a34.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"384\" height=\"145\"></a></p>",
